  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Exploration 3: Safer Social Media\r\n\r\n**Inquiry Question**: How can we update images that we provide to AI to account for safety and privacy?\r\n\r\n1. Examine one of the social media posts present and analyze possible data what you see. List data points visible within the post into three categories: public, private, and sensitive.\r\n2. Import the image into the AI Chat on Level 2 and ask it multiple questions about the person who might have made the social media post.\r\n3. Drag and resize the black boxes to \"anonymize\" private or sensitive data in the image.\r\n\r\n\r\n",
